        "text": "Another set of easy Qur'anic Vocabulary — Sifaat-e-Ilaahi (Asma-ul-Husna)",
        "title": "Another set of easy Qur'anic Vocabulary — Sifaat-e-Ilaahi (Asma-ul-Husna)",
