    {
      "id": "sec_s1l9_r2",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Quran-e-Majeed mein Allah Ta'ala ki sifaat baar baar aayi hain aur yeh aksar humare naamon ka hissa bhi hoti hain. Yahan aisi hi chand sifaat hain jinhe aap ba-aasani samajh sakte hain. Nisbatan nayi sifaat ke maani de diye gaye hain.",
        "content": "Quran-e-Majeed mein Allah Ta'ala ki sifaat baar baar aayi hain aur yeh aksar humare naamon ka hissa bhi hoti hain. Yahan aisi hi chand sifaat hain jinhe aap ba-aasani samajh sakte hain. Nisbatan nayi sifaat ke maani de diye gaye hain.",
        "hinglish_text": "Quran-e-Majeed mein Allah Ta'ala ki sifaat baar baar aayi hain aur yeh aksar humare naamon ka hissa bhi hoti hain. Yahan aisi hi chand sifaat hain jinhe aap ba-aasani samajh sakte hain. Nisbatan nayi sifaat ke maani de diye gaye hain."
      }
    },
